"As mentioned above Quarkus tests are actually full CDI beans, and as such "
"you can apply CDI interceptors as you would\n"
"normally. As an example, if you want a test method to run within the context "
"of a transaction you can simply apply the\n"
"`@Transactional` annotation to the method and the transaction interceptor "
"will handle it."
msgstr ""

